    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596470/extras/3c7ac6bb3d1d6e2419df86fa957fc791.poster.avif?t=1750849365\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596470/extras/3c7ac6bb3d1d6e2419df86fa957fc791.webm?t=1750849365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596470/extras/3c7ac6bb3d1d6e2419df86fa957fc791.mp4?t=1750849365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Night Swamp</strong> is an <strong>action-RPG</strong> mixing high-intensity, time-limited dungeon runs with a <strong>3D tower defense</strong>-style system where you must prepare your village against an impending invasion. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 EARN YOUR SURVIVAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unstoppable army is approaching. You have minutes to gear up, dive into the swamps, and gather what you need to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt monsters, collect rare materials, and make it back alive. Every second counts\u2014and every decision could be the one that saves your village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596470/extras/3a21a1e0653ca60988b0ce8f8998a174.poster.avif?t=1750849365\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596470/extras/3a21a1e0653ca60988b0ce8f8998a174.webm?t=1750849365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596470/extras/3a21a1e0653ca60988b0ce8f8998a174.mp4?t=1750849365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f MASTER YOUR ARSENAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip demonic weapons, cast devastating elemental spells, harness runes with wild powers, and deploy powerful defenses across the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From deadly traps to arcane towers, you'll need every tool at your disposal... and even then, it might not be enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When night falls, something worse than monsters may be waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tick-tock. Tick-tock...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596470/extras/599a68105d39b98533cbd523b0f75815.poster.avif?t=1750849365\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596470/extras/599a68105d39b98533cbd523b0f75815.webm?t=1750849365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596470/extras/599a68105d39b98533cbd523b0f75815.mp4?t=1750849365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i> </i><br><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596470/extras/3c7ac6bb3d1d6e2419df86fa957fc791.poster.avif?t=1750849365\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596470/extras/3c7ac6bb3d1d6e2419df86fa957fc791.webm?t=1750849365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596470/extras/3c7ac6bb3d1d6e2419df86fa957fc791.mp4?t=1750849365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Night Swamp</strong> is an <strong>action-RPG</strong> mixing high-intensity, time-limited dungeon runs with a <strong>3D tower defense</strong>-style system where you must prepare your village against an impending invasion. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 EARN YOUR SURVIVAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unstoppable army is approaching. You have minutes to gear up, dive into the swamps, and gather what you need to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt monsters, collect rare materials, and make it back alive. Every second counts\u2014and every decision could be the one that saves your village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596470/extras/3a21a1e0653ca60988b0ce8f8998a174.poster.avif?t=1750849365\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596470/extras/3a21a1e0653ca60988b0ce8f8998a174.webm?t=1750849365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596470/extras/3a21a1e0653ca60988b0ce8f8998a174.mp4?t=1750849365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f MASTER YOUR ARSENAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip demonic weapons, cast devastating elemental spells, harness runes with wild powers, and deploy powerful defenses across the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From deadly traps to arcane towers, you'll need every tool at your disposal... and even then, it might not be enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When night falls, something worse than monsters may be waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tick-tock. Tick-tock...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596470/extras/599a68105d39b98533cbd523b0f75815.poster.avif?t=1750849365\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596470/extras/599a68105d39b98533cbd523b0f75815.webm?t=1750849365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596470/extras/599a68105d39b98533cbd523b0f75815.mp4?t=1750849365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i> </i><br><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
